Z||000001||Raydar||11-13-1999||11:04 AM||||Tom... I might suggest something that would hold a standard 5"-6" woofer. It's a pain in the butt to find exact replacement speakers. What might also be of interest is a housing to mount a sub where there never was one, before (as is my case). I am planning to attempt this, using MDF, sometime in the not-too-distant future. (Haven't examined this, too closely. May not be practical.) <BR>A housing made of formed plastic would be great, if it could be made rigid enough. <BR>I've seen subs mounted in the console, where the door used to be. Probably sound great, but with the shortage of storage space, not very practical.<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 11-13-1999).]||||reg||1
